# UI Patterns

## App Structure

- `AppShell` (`lib/ui/app_shell.dart`): Root shell with `NavigationBar` (5 tabs)
- Tab pages use plain `Scaffold` with AppBar
- Detail pages (reading views) push full-screen above the shell via `parentNavigatorKey`

## Navigation

```dart
// Switch to a tab
context.go('/quran');

// Push a detail page (full screen, no bottom nav)
context.push('/quran/1');
context.push('/quran/2?ayah=255');
context.push('/hadith/forties/nawawi40.json?title=Nawawi%2040');
context.push('/search');
```

## Scope Access

- Font zoom: `SettingsScope.of(context).arabicZoom` / `.englishZoom`
- Theme toggle: `AppScope.of(context).toggleTheme()`
- Bookmarks: `BookmarkScope.of(context)`
- Theme mode: `Theme.of(context).brightness`

## Quran Detail Page

- Shows Bismillah header for all surahs except Al-Fatiha (1) and At-Tawbah (9)
- Each ayah has a styled number badge + bookmark icon
- Arabic with tajweed coloring + English translation below
- Tajweed legend at the bottom
- Saves last-read position automatically

## Hadith Book Page

- Each hadith has a styled number badge + bookmark icon
- Narrator shown in a distinct container
- Arabic without tajweed + English below
- Saves last-read position automatically

## Search

- Debounced text input (300ms)
- Results grouped by Quran / Hadith with counts
- Results navigate to detail pages with scroll-to position

## Reusable Widgets

- `ArabicText` -- Arabic rendering with Tajweed support
- `GradientTile` -- Card with gradient background, icon, title, subtitle
